{"availability":"available","full":"fizzexual/Codemonkey","name":"Codemonkey","description":"A minimalist typing-speed test for developers: like Monkeytype, but you type real code snippets in 9 languages and get WPM, accuracy and consistency. Vanilla JS, no backend. 🍂","category":"Education","language":"JavaScript","stars":22,"forks":3,"created":"2026-06-19T19:55:24Z","updated":"2026-10-05T17:52:28Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://fizzexual.github.io/Codemonkey/","topics":["developer-tools","github-pages","javascript","monkeytype","typing-speed","typing-test","vanilla-js"],"demo":"https://fizzexual.github.io/Codemonkey/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.212Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.212Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.212Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.212Z","stars":22,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Monkeytype, but for code. A minimalist typing‑speed test where you type real code snippets and measure your WPM, accuracy, and consistency — no sign‑up, no backend, no build step.","Codemonkey is a browser typing test for programmers who want to practise typing real code instead of prose. It is a static site in plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript with no build step and no backend, hosted on GitHub Pages. Status: working and live; a small personal project with hand-written snippets in 9 languages.","Typing tests use prose. But the stuff developers actually type all day — brackets, semicolons, camelCase, indentation — never shows up. codemonkey drops real, idiomatic code in front of you and clocks how fast you can type it, the same clean way Monkeytype does for words."],"features":["A near‑endless pool of correct content — 274 hand‑written code snippets across 9 languages","(JavaScript · Python · TypeScript · Java · C++ · Go · Rust · SQL · Bash), each verified to compile or parse, plus a quotes mode of 70 famous programming & wisdom lines. No immediate repeats, and the pool is trivially…","Smart auto‑indentation — press Enter and the next line's leading whitespace is","filled in for you, so you only ever type the characters that matter (more below).","time — type as much as you can in 15 / 30 / 60 / 120 seconds."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fizzexual/Codemonkey/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"dad991dd6b46825c75b31bb203bf75b2953c6ea8da2b3fd7531f292909697810","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.347Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.347Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Monkeytype, but for code. A minimalist typing‑speed test where you type real code snippets and measure your WPM, accuracy, and consistency — no sign‑up, no backend, no build step.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fizzexual/Codemonkey/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"dad991dd6b46825c75b31bb203bf75b2953c6ea8da2b3fd7531f292909697810","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fizzexual/Codemonkey/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.348Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T17:52:28Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/fizzexual/Codemonkey/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T07:22:03.349Z","hash":"dad991dd6b46825c75b31bb203bf75b2953c6ea8da2b3fd7531f292909697810","originalBytes":6811,"storedBytes":6811,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["type","codemonkey","css","snippets","line","typing","add","indentation","auto","build","code","enter","live","real","wpm","index.html","language","test","theme","accuracy","filled","github","how","html","javascript","license","monkeytype","new","pages","plain","project","snippet","snippets.js","start","static","stats","style.css","themes.js","whitespace","automatically.","backend","bash","build.","built","character","characters","clone","comes","consistency","content","correct","counts","dependencies","deployment","drop","each","engine","entry","file","genuinely","graph","help